---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="Peptide OEM & Private Label from China — Custom Vials" description="OEM and private-label research peptide supply from China: custom labels, boxes, documentation packages and batch traceability for brands and distributors." canonical="/oem-private-label/">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> › OEM / Private Label</p>
    <h1>OEM &amp; private label</h1>
    <p class="lead muted" style="max-width:820px;">If you sell under your own brand, the product is only half the job — the label, the box, the documentation and the consistency between batches are what your buyers judge. We build that package with you.</p>

    <h2>What can be customized</h2>
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Options</th><th>Minimum</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Vial label</td><td>Your brand, SKU, strength, batch, RUO statement, QR to COA</td><td>500 labels per SKU</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Box / carton</td><td>Printed box, insert card, security seal</td><td>500 units</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Documentation pack</td><td>Branded COA template, MSDS, storage card</td><td>With first order</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Vial format</td><td>2/3/5/10 mL amber or clear, crimp or flip-off</td><td>By SKU</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Batch coding</td><td>Your batch convention or ours</td><td>By agreement</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>Process</h2>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Brief:</strong> product list, strengths, volumes, target markets.</li>
      <li><strong>Compliance review:</strong> we check label claims and destination requirements before design.</li>
      <li><strong>Design &amp; proof:</strong> artwork proof, label content review, sample approval.</li>
      <li><strong>Production:</strong> batch manufacture, fill, label, pack, QC release.</li>
      <li><strong>Documents:</strong> branded COA per batch, MSDS, invoice and packing list.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2>Label rules we will not bend</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>No therapeutic, dosing or human-use claims.</li>
      <li>"For laboratory research use only" must appear on label and box.</li>
      <li>No fake certification marks or unverifiable standards.</li>
      <li>Batch number and expiry must be printed, not implied.</li>
    </ul>

    <p><a class="btn" href="/contact/">Discuss an OEM project</a> <a class="wa-btn" href={site.whatsappLink} target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="margin-left:10px;">💬 WhatsApp inquiry</a></p>
    <div class="ruo" style="margin:28px 0;">{site.ruo}</div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
